  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/ImproDruida1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Druida Bar&amp;Drinks, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, ha acollit aquest dijous el primer acte del I Festival d&#39;Improvisaci&oacute; Vila d&#39;Onda, a c&agrave;rrec d&#39;Arteatre,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/ImproDruida2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>que es repetir&agrave; dijous 30 de novembre, tamb&eacute; a les 19 hores, a Chaplin Caf&eacute;, del carrer de Falcons.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9261.jpg\" alt=\"img_9261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9262.jpg\" alt=\"img_9262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9263.jpg\" alt=\"img_9263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9264.jpg\" alt=\"img_9264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9269.jpg\" alt=\"img_9269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9270.jpg\" alt=\"img_9270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9271.jpg\" alt=\"img_9271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9272.jpg\" alt=\"img_9272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/improdruida/img_9273.jpg\" alt